cts, viewing\na project\u0027s contacts, updating a client\u0027s engagement status, and\nundoing changes. Each has a main success scenario and extensions for\ninvalid input, duplicates and empty results.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":242,"deletions":10}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-30T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"aa5fba2c7517f2fdfbe00c708be1d46712aa679b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #21 from arcs1ne/branch-update-aboutus","messageBody":"Add Tan Ying\u0027s details to AboutUs page","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e6f5d7057bb7aa28be430dc27a7d06559de4e495","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #19 from ry-cy/branch-update-aboutus","messageBody":"Add Ryan\u0027s details to AboutUs page","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"b52d38833dbeeedc1e3703209cdc88e6a0dedc59","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #23 from ry-cy/branch-ryan-week-7-a","messageBody":"Update README.md based on week 7 tasks","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"efdfdf4ca0f9837e9b655fd947c43699ebfacb88","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove placeholder members from the About Us page","messageBody":"The About Us page still lists John Doe and Jean Doe, placeholders left\nover from AB3, alongside the three of us.\n\nLet\u0027s remove them, so the page lists only our team.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":0,"deletions":20}}}]}],"arcs1ne":[{"date":"2026-09-29T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"f4df1cbd1e7a03c1559584f978d42004c60dc0b3","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #17 from ry-cy/add-ryans-photo","messageBody":"Add Ryan\u0027s photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"26051a4592c30582fab381e17472fb2599bbfc8